---@field state? gcp.bigqueryreservation_v1.CapacityCommitmentStateEnum|string Output only. State of the commitment.
---@field slotCount? string Optional. Number of slots in this commitment.
---@field plan? gcp.bigqueryreservation_v1.CapacityCommitmentPlanEnum|string Optional. Capacity commitment commitment plan.
---@field renewalPlan? gcp.bigqueryreservation_v1.CapacityCommitmentRenewalPlanEnum|string Optional. The plan this capacity commitment is converted to after commitment_end_time passes. Once the plan is changed, committed period is extended according to commitment plan. Only applicable for ANNUAL and TRIAL commitments.
